# Fuzzy combobox: type in the Owner cell to filter people
Output "tui-01-combobox.gif"
Output "raw/tui-01-combobox.mp4"
Source "../tapes/_setup.tape"
Sleep 800ms
Right 3
Sleep 400ms
# open: the control opens here (compose4.py syncs the 2x2 clips on it)
Type "fr"
Sleep 1500ms
Screenshot "raw/tui-01-combobox.png"
Sleep 1500ms
Escape
Escape
Sleep 500ms
